      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "{\"v\":1,\"title\":\"Qwen Image 2.1 Edit\",\"subtitle\":\"A source, an instruction, a matching canvas. Compare the change before saving.\",\"author\":\"AusBoss\",\"layout\":\"card\",\"accent\":\"#78b39a\",\"body\":\"## Start here\\nCopy `ausboss_pier_sunrise.png` from the pack's `example_workflows/inputs/` folder into `ComfyUI/input/`, or choose your own image. Select the three downloaded models and queue.\\n\\n## Make the edit\\n1. **Image Resize** sets a 1 MP working image and snaps its edges to 32 pixels. It starts in megapixels mode.\\n2. **Text** describes the change. Name the subject to preserve and refer to the source as `<image1>`.\\n3. **Qwen Encode** reads the source with its VAE and returns both conditioning and a matching empty latent. Resolution 0 keeps the already resized picture.\\n4. **Compare** slides the result against that working image. **Save Image** writes a PNG with this workflow inside.\\n\\n## More references\\nConnect another Load Image to the encoder's next image socket, then name it `<image2>` in the instruction. Continue for up to 10 references. The first image determines the output size; leave the encoder's latent wired to the sampler.\\n\\n## Sampling\\n25 steps, CFG 1, Euler / simple, denoise 1. These starting values match the supplied template. Try 40 steps for a more complete render. Negative text has no effect at CFG 1. The cache starts at auto / default.\\n\\n## Models\\nEach Download button below names its destination under `ComfyUI/models/`. Refresh the model list after copying files. The model repository also provides optional BF16 alternatives.\",\"models\":[{\"name\":\"qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors\",\"dir\":\"diffusion_models\",\"size\":\"7.26 GB\",\"note\":\"Selected INT8 diffusion model.\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors\"},{\"name\":\"qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors\",\"dir\":\"text_encoders\",\"size\":\"9.35 GB\",\"note\":\"Selected Qwen3-VL 8B encoder; CLIP type: qwen_image.\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors\"},{\"name\":\"qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors\",\"dir\":\"vae\",\"size\":\"676 MB\",\"note\":\"Use the Qwen Image 2.1 VAE.\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/vae/qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors\"}],\"packs\":[],\"links\":[{\"label\":\"Qwen 2.1 model files + BF16 alternatives\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1\"},{\"label\":\"Qwen model guide\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1\"}]}",
        ""
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "note": "{\"v\":1,\"title\":\"Qwen Image 2.1 Edit\",\"subtitle\":\"A source, an instruction, a matching canvas. Compare the change before saving.\",\"author\":\"AusBoss\",\"layout\":\"card\",\"accent\":\"#78b39a\",\"body\":\"## Start here\\nCopy `ausboss_pier_sunrise.png` from the pack's `example_workflows/inputs/` folder into `ComfyUI/input/`, or choose your own image. Select the three downloaded models and queue.\\n\\n## Make the edit\\n1. **Image Resize** sets a 1 MP working image and snaps its edges to 32 pixels. It starts in megapixels mode.\\n2. **Text** describes the change. Name the subject to preserve and refer to the source as `<image1>`.\\n3. **Qwen Encode** reads the source with its VAE and returns both conditioning and a matching empty latent. Resolution 0 keeps the already resized picture.\\n4. **Compare** slides the result against that working image. **Save Image** writes a PNG with this workflow inside.\\n\\n## More references\\nConnect another Load Image to the encoder's next image socket, then name it `<image2>` in the instruction. Continue for up to 10 references. The first image determines the output size; leave the encoder's latent wired to the sampler.\\n\\n## Sampling\\n25 steps, CFG 1, Euler / simple, denoise 1. These starting values match the supplied template. Try 40 steps for a more complete render. Negative text has no effect at CFG 1. The cache starts at auto / default.\\n\\n## Models\\nEach Download button below names its destination under `ComfyUI/models/`. Refresh the model list after copying files. The model repository also provides optional BF16 alternatives.\",\"models\":[{\"name\":\"qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors\",\"dir\":\"diffusion_models\",\"size\":\"7.26 GB\",\"note\":\"Selected INT8 diffusion model.\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors\"},{\"name\":\"qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors\",\"dir\":\"text_encoders\",\"size\":\"9.35 GB\",\"note\":\"Selected Qwen3-VL 8B encoder; CLIP type: qwen_image.\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors\"},{\"name\":\"qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors\",\"dir\":\"vae\",\"size\":\"676 MB\",\"note\":\"Use the Qwen Image 2.1 VAE.\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/vae/qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors\"}],\"packs\":[],\"links\":[{\"label\":\"Qwen 2.1 model files + BF16 alternatives\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1\"},{\"label\":\"Qwen model guide\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1\"}]}",
